# Bot2's Chain of Smog makes Bot1 discard two cards at once on turn 2: one trigger, "for each card discarded this way" =
# +4/+0, so Howler is 9/4 until end of turn. Howler deals no combat damage to a player, so Bot1 draws nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Captain Howler, Sea Scourge
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Swamp
Chain of Smog
Swamp x17

